            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wangu anaamba hivi, “Chirise cho chaa cha mangʼondzi na mbuzi ndichotsindzwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho agagulao anagatsindza wala taatiywa adabu, na nyo achuuzi nkuamba, ‘Naatogolwe Mwenyezi Mlungu mana hukakala matajiri!’ Na hata nyo arisa aho piya taagaonera mbazi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Mimi sindaonera mbazi tsona atu asagalao tsi hino. Nindahenda chila mmwenga amgalukire jiraniwe na niatiye mikononi mwa mfalume wao, nao andabananga yo tsi, nami sindativya hata mmwenga kula mwao mikononi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nákala mrisa wa chaa cha mangʼondzi na mbuzi za kutsindzwa ambazo kala ni za achuuzi. Náhala ndata mbiri, mwenga nchiyiiha Mbazi na yanjina nchiyiiha Umwenga, nami nchimanyirira go mangʼondzi na mbuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi náusa arisa a hahu ndani ya mwezi mmwenga, mana siyaavumirira nao achikala akanimena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nami nchiamba, “Sindakala mrisa wenu tsona. Ga kufwa nagafwe, ga kuangamika nagaangamike na go ndigosala nagaryane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchihala yo ndata yangu yiihwayo Mbazi nchiivundza, ili nivundze cho chilagane nrichoika na mataifa gosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi cho chilagane chavundzwa siku iyo, na nyo achuuzi a mangʼondzi ariokala ananilola, achimanya kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu kala anagomba nao kpwa go nrigokala nikahenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.9+MAT.27.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 27:9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 26:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nami nchiaambira, “Ichikala munaona ni sawa kpwenu, niphani maripho gangu, ela mchiona sivyo sawa kalani nago.” Phahi achiniripha vipande mirongo mihahu vya feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Mtsuphire mfinyangi wa nyungu vyo vipande mirongo mihahu vya feza, maripho machache sana ambago náhewa ni nyo atu.” Phahi návihala nchimtsuphira ye mfinyangi yekala ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchivundza ndata yangu ya phiri iriyoihwa Umwenga, ili kuvundza udugu wa Juda na Iziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Vihale tsona vyo vitu vya mrisa mzuzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mana vivi ni phephi niike mrisa kahi ya yo tsi ambaye kandajali mangʼondzi na mbuzi ziangamikazo, kandaendza chizotsamukana, kandalagula chizolumira wala kurisato ndzima. Ela andarya go mangʼondzi na mbuzi zirizonona na kuafuna hadi makpwatsa gao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
